@startuml
title AISafe Flight Management System - System Context (C4 Level 1)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
left to right direction

actor "Backoffice Operator" as BO
actor "ATCC\n(Air Transport Company\nCollaborator)" as ATCC
actor "Maintenance Technician" as TECH
actor "Maintenance Supervisor" as SUP
actor "Administrator" as ADM

rectangle "AISafe Flight Management System\n(distributed: 5 services x 2 replicas)\n\nManages the aircraft fleet, airports,\nroutes and scheduled flights,\nmaintenance activities and\nuser authentication" as AISafe #E8EEF6

BO --> AISafe : registers aircraft models,\nairports and their status\n[HTTPS/REST + JWT]
ATCC --> AISafe : manages aircraft, routes\nand schedules flights\n[HTTPS/REST + JWT]
TECH --> AISafe : creates and executes\nmaintenance records\n[HTTPS/REST + JWT]
SUP --> AISafe : reviews maintenance reports,\ncosts and parts inventory\n[HTTPS/REST + JWT]
ADM --> AISafe : full access\n[HTTPS/REST + JWT]

note bottom of AISafe
  No external systems: every user logs in through
  POST /auth/login and receives a JWT (username, roles).
  Clients in Assignment 1: Postman collections.
end note
@enduml
